OL,3,GNEWSANest of England's rarest ant
OL,4,Aspecies 'stolen'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nest belonging to England's rarest
OL,7,Fant species has been stolen, a
OL,8,Fconservation charity believes.
OL,10,FDevon Wildlife Trust said the
OL,11,Fnarrow-headed ants' nest was taken from
OL,12,Fits Chudleigh Knighton Heath reserve in
OL,13,FDevon - the last stronghold for the
OL,14,Fspecies in England.
OL,16,FIt claimed the surrounding ground
OL,17,Fshowed "clear signs of digging with a
OL,18,Fspade" and it has reported the matter
OL,19,Fto Devon and Cornwall Police which is
OL,20,Furging anyone with information to come
OL,21,Fforward.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
