OL,3,GNEWSANest of England's rarest ant
OL,4,Aspecies 'stolen'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe wildlife trust's species recovery
OL,7,Fofficer Julia Balfour said the removal
OL,8,Fof the nest marked a "significant loss
OL,9,Ffor this species" and was "every bit as
OL,10,Fserious as illegal raids on wild bird
OL,11,Feggs".
